# A fourteenth Russian story: the wedding banquet
subtitle: "Sixty guests, three children, two fathers who are cooks and a supplier ninety minutes late: Tom's story of a wedding banquet from the kitchen, to read and hear in Russian."
tags: ["russian","russian reading","russian story","wedding","petersburg"]
teaches: ["reading/reading-stories"]
thumb: "band \"A fourteenth Russian story: the wedding banquet\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Each other in Russian: друг друга","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/141-russian-each-other.cast"}

