A: Дека́брь. О́льга is back from Moscow, and she wants to know about the wedding. Послу́шайте.
    draw o_olga o_olga_n o_tom o_tom_n o_wed o_dec

    ask "What does Ольга ask Tom about?" listen [{"voice":"b","who":"О́льга","text":"Том, я верну́лась! Ну, как сва́дьба?","gloss":"Tom, I'm back! So, how was the wedding?"},{"voice":"a","who":"Том","text":"Всё бы́ло хорошо́… почти́ всё.","gloss":"Everything went well… almost everything."},{"voice":"b","who":"О́льга","text":"Почти́? Расскажи́!","gloss":"Almost? Tell me!"},{"voice":"a","who":"Том","text":"Сейча́с расскажу́. Я всё написа́л.","gloss":"I'll tell you now. I wrote it all down."}] options ["the new menu","the wedding banquet","her trip to Moscow"] correct 2
        right: Как сва́дьба? The wedding.
        wrong: Ну, как сва́дьба? The wedding.
    voice b

    ask "How did it go, says Tom?" listen same options ["very badly","he doesn't know yet","almost everything went well"] correct 3
        right: Почти́ всё: almost everything.
        wrong: Всё бы́ло хорошо́… почти́ всё.
    voice b

    erase o_olga o_olga_n o_tom o_tom_n o_wed o_dec

A: Three new words: танцева́ть, to dance; тост, a toast at the table; and крем, the cream on a cake.
    draw nw1 nw2 nw3

    erase nw1 nw2 nw3

