    quiz "At a wedding, one of the fathers, a cook himself, tastes the fish: «Ры́ба вкусне́е, чем у меня́!» He means…" shuffle false voice a
        right: Пра́вильно! Вкусне́е: tastier than his.
        wrong: Вкусне́е, чем у меня́: tastier than mine.
        * his own is better
        + it's better than his own
        * it needs more salt

