A: Шесть вопро́сов. The next day, Алёна, the bride, phones me. Послу́шайте.
    icon t_alyona size 160 set twemoji x 130 y 470 or ["woman"] icon_look picture of "bride with veil"
    text t_alyona_n "Алёна · неве́ста" #8f887c x 140 y 345 font_size 28
    icon t_phone size 90 set twemoji x 500 y 640 or ["mobile phone"] icon_look picture of "telephone receiver"
    icon t_tom size 160 set twemoji x 880 y 470 or ["man"] icon_look picture of "man cook"
    text t_tom_n "Том" #8f887c x 880 y 345 font_size 30

    ask "Алёна, the bride, phones Tom. What does she thank him for?" listen [{"voice":"b","who":"Алёна","text":"Том, здра́вствуйте! Э́то Алёна. Спаси́бо за банке́т!","gloss":"Hello, Tom! It's Alyona. Thank you for the banquet!"},{"voice":"a","who":"Том","text":"Здра́вствуйте, Алёна! Всё бы́ло вку́сно?","gloss":"Hello, Alyona! Was everything good?"},{"voice":"b","who":"Алёна","text":"Всё! А торт был са́мый вку́сный. Мы танцева́ли весь ве́чер!","gloss":"Everything! And the cake was the best. We danced all evening!"},{"voice":"a","who":"Том","text":"Я о́чень рад! Приходи́те к нам ещё.","gloss":"I'm very glad! Come to us again."}] options ["the banquet","a cake recipe","a taxi home"] correct 1 test t1
        right: Спаси́бо за банке́т!
        wrong: Спаси́бо за банке́т: for the banquet.
    voice a

    ask "Алёна, the bride, phones Tom about her wedding banquet. What was the best thing, for her?" listen same options ["the cake","the fish","the soup"] correct 1 test t1
        right: Торт был са́мый вку́сный.
        wrong: Торт был са́мый вку́сный: the cake.
    voice a

    ask "Алёна, the bride, phones Tom about her wedding banquet. What did the guests do all evening?" listen same options ["they danced","they sang","they walked by the river"] correct 1 test t1
        right: Мы танцева́ли весь ве́чер!
        wrong: Мы танцева́ли весь ве́чер: they danced.
    voice a

    erase t_alyona t_alyona_n t_phone t_tom t_tom_n

