    '|a||A fourteenth Russian story: the wedding banquet':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4160
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Sixty guests, three children, two fathers who are cooks and a supplier ninety minutes late: Tom''s story of a wedding banquet from the kitchen, to read and hear in Russian.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 13120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:txpz0u'
    '|a||Дека́брь. О́льга is back from Moscow, and she wants to know about the wedding. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6680
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Том, я верну́лась! Ну, как сва́дьба?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3200
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:2u2zvb'
    '|a||Всё бы́ло хорошо́… почти́ всё.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3120
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Почти́? Расскажи́!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2040
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Сейча́с расскажу́. Я всё написа́л.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2840
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||What does Ольга ask Tom about?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2840
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||Как сва́дьба? The wedding.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2600
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||How did it go, says Tom?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2400
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||Почти́ всё: almost everything.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2760
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Three new words: танцева́ть, to dance; тост, a toast at the table; and крем, the cream on a cake.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10200
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Прочита́йте. Three pages, no stress marks: before the banquet, the evening, the cake.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:we5u11'
    '|a||В суббо́ту в «Неве́» была́ сва́дьба.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:a0xk9f'
    '|a||Пришло́ шестьдеся́т челове́к и тро́е дете́й.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:v4hdb7'
    '|a||Зал, в кото́ром был банке́т, на второ́м этаже́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:hfpa9'
    '|a||Ты сказа́ла: «Не забу́дь позвони́ть поставщику́!»':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:qo0l3z'
    '|a||Я позвони́л, но поставщи́к опозда́л на полтора́ часа́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:e3xye5'
    '|a||Хорошо́, что ры́ба была́ на второ́е: мы успе́ли.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:9bmc0l'
    '|a||Торт привезли́ в коро́бках, и нам пришло́сь отнести́ их наве́рх.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:j7btgh'
    '|a||Да́льше: the evening, in the hall and in the kitchen.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1ryeocd'
    '|a||Весь ве́чер го́сти танцева́ли и говори́ли то́сты.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:5s41lt'
    '|a||На ку́хне нам не хвата́ло люде́й.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1clnm06'
    '|a||Но мне удало́сь пригото́вить всё, что хоте́ла неве́ста.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:xnjpp1'
    '|a||В де́вять о́ба отца́ пришли́ на ку́хню.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:pcqt6i'
    '|a||Они́ то́же повара́, как я.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1f4ei09'
    '|a||Оди́н попро́бовал ры́бу и сказа́л: «Ры́ба вкусне́е, чем у меня́!»':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:2nc71g'
    '|a||А друго́й хоте́л узна́ть реце́пт.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1yh796f'
    '|a||Не хвата́ло, удало́сь: lesson 136, a dative, no я.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:19oiqwo'
    '|a||At a wedding, one of the fathers, a cook himself, tastes the fish: «Ры́ба вкусне́е, чем у меня́!» He means…':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:z5jtfp'
    '|a||Пра́вильно! Вкусне́е: tastier than his.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4000
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Да́льше: the cake, and the almost.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3960
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||В де́сять мы принесли́ торт.':
